ging from turquoise  and white to pink and gold to silver and  green it is common for gyro gliders to  mate with one that does not possess  their own color scheme this practice  continues to produce wide arrays of  different shades and color combinations  gyro blinders lay their eggs in  treacherous waters full of hidden rocks  and boulders there by discouraging  predators from making a meal their eggs  are round and numerous like a fishes and  coated with an adhesive that anchors the  eggs to the rocks the young hatch within  30 days and will spend the first few  weeks of their life in the water until  their wings develop afterwards they will  spin and loop up to the rest of the  colony ready to become the next  generation of daredevil jumpers  [Music]  hop serve uppers a charming and modely  entertaining species hop servers were  created by the flu elves about a hundred  years ago using an array of housework  and cooking spells the hop serve offers  goal to prepare and serve delicious food  wherever and whenever a banquet is held  the hop serve opera resembles a large  white egg with a single colored dot in  the center of their faces that  superficially looks like a simple I  usually blue or green when the hop serve  Opera is not preparing food this dot  will change color depending on how near  a meal that creature is preparing is to  completion when the circle turns red or  pink the food is ready to serve what  makes the hop survivors so intriguing is  that they prepare the food inside their  bodies with the help of the magic given  to them by the flu during their creation  when hop survivors have finished making  food they crack open to reveal the meal  inside which can range from steaming  piles of meat and delicious balls of  soups to beautifully arranged fruits and  desserts once the food is taken the hop  survivor closes again without any harm  and goes back to preparing food as  needed until a feast is done hop servers  move around on a single human-like fo